WEBVTT

00:02:58.729 --> 00:03:00.843
čitav niz trenutaka,

00:03:00.843 --> 00:03:03.088
i zato naš potpuni osećaj sebe

00:03:03.088 --> 00:03:06.020
traži i duboko iskustvo

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:08.465
i protok vremena.

00:03:08.465 --> 00:03:11.614
Protok vremena je uključen u sve,

00:03:11.614 --> 00:03:14.182
u eroziju zrna peska,

00:03:14.182 --> 00:03:17.974
u pupljenje malog pupoljka u ružu.

00:03:17.974 --> 00:03:20.509
Bez toga, ne bismo imali muziku.

00:03:20.509 --> 00:03:22.547
Naše emocije i stanje svesti

00:03:22.547 --> 00:03:24.660
često kodiraju vreme,

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.218
žaljenje i nostalgija za prošlošću,

00:03:27.218 --> 00:03:30.718
nada ili strah za budućnošću.